    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for vector indexes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Vector indexes enable similarity search over high-dimensional embeddings. Common implementations include HNSW, IVF, and PQ-based indexes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
